description_text:
3D model of wire basket display for chocolate bars. Created in two resolutions: hi-res and low poly (3730 faces).
Model is available in the following formats:

  - STEP (solid geometry) ;

  - STL (hi-res) ;

  - FBX (hi-res) ;

  - FBX (low res) ;

  - OBJ ;

  - COLLADA ;

  - WRML ;

JUNK SHACK - POST APOCALYPTIC

  - 17 unique parts

  - PBR material

  - low poly models

  - clear geometry

Polycount:

  - WoodenFenceCorner - 20 polygons;

  - WoodenFence - 152 polygons;

  - ShackDoor - 154 polygons;

  - Shack1 - 2,699 polygons;

  - Shack2 - 4,844 polygons;

  - Shack3 - 4,432 polygons;

  - JunkWallCorner - 4,436 polygons;

  - JunkWall1 - 4,008 polygons;

  - JunkWall2 - 3,158 polygons;

  - MetalPipe - 48 polygons;

  - MetalPlate1 - 34 polygons;

  - MetalPlate2 - 20 polygons;

  - MetalPlate3 - 84 polygons;

  - MetalPlate4 - 2 polygons;

  - MetalPlate5 - 28 polygons;

  - MetalPlate6 - 82 polygons;

  - Tire - 968 polygons;

Material:

  - PBR material

  - Albedo, Normal, Roughness, Metalness, Alpha.

  - Unreal Engine 4 ready.

  - Collision included.

Jeep Wrangler Unlimited 2019 on a small scale
Model on a scale of 1:72 to 1:192;
